.av-av_hr-e20845366ecf4191d9d28e96992d31d2 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-av_hr-e20845366ecf4191d9d28e96992d31d2 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-av_one_half-8cdbb378864195f7b9517e600bbf174b sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-av_one_half-8cdbb378864195f7b9517e600bbf174b av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-mp2l7wos-b53b51231743d42912df76c42e7c7596 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"826\"><strong>Vom 29. bis 31. Mai 2026<\/strong> wird die Marke <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Venol<\/span><\/span> auf der internationalen Automobilmesse <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Expomec\u00e2nica Porto 2026<\/span><\/span> in Portugal vertreten sein.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"1047\">Wir laden alle Gesch\u00e4ftspartner, Kunden sowie Interessenten an einer Zusammenarbeit herzlich ein, w\u00e4hrend der Messe Kontakt mit uns aufzunehmen.<br data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"975\" \/>Unser Team steht Ihnen w\u00e4hrend der gesamten Veranstaltung zur Verf\u00fcgung.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1190\"><strong data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1098\">Kontakt w\u00e4hrend der Messe (Telefon\/WhatsApp):<\/strong><br data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1101\" \/>\ud83d\udcde +48 661 570 400 \u2013 Justyna Kacprzyk-Pietrzak<br data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1150\" \/>\ud83d\udcde +48 665 084 900 \u2013 Marta Chrustowicz<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1210\">Bis bald in Porto!<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-av_one_half-421c1bf5d4c122db8f22821bc87bc328 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-4  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-mp2l7ku4-8fb02e22e9ab14f5e92dbf985f4340ff\">\n.avia-image-container.av-mp2l7ku4-8fb02e22e9ab14f5e92dbf985f4340ff img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-mp2l7ku4-8fb02e22e9ab14f5e92dbf985f4340ff .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-mp2l7ku4-8fb02e22e9ab14f5e92dbf985f4340ff av-styling- avia-align-center  avia-builder-el-5  avia-builder-el-no-sibling '   itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><div class=\"avia-image-container-inner\"><div class=\"avia-image-overlay-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class='wp-image-5374 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-5374 avia_image ' src=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-venol-2-1030x1030.png\" alt='' title='porto-venol'  height=\"1030\" width=\"1030\"  itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\" srcset=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-venol-2-1030x1030.png 1030w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-venol-2-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-venol-2-80x80.png 80w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-venol-2-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-venol-2-1536x1536.png 1536w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-venol-2-36x36.png 36w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/porto-ve